# Section isolation

When the user asks to work on a specific section (e.g. Results, Credentials, Contact):

- Change only that section’s component, styles, and direct dependencies.
- Do **not** modify sections that appear before it in the page order (Introduction → Results → Credentials → Contact).
- Do not “fix up,” retune, or restyle prior sections unless the user explicitly asks.
- Shared CSS (`index.css`, Morse, nav) may change only when required for the target section — and must not alter earlier sections’ layout or look.
